style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Stefan Denninger\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"heading\",\"version\":1,\"tag\":\"h2\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":3,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Eigenaar & personal coach\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1,\"$\":{\"fontFamily\":\"montserrat\",\"color\":\"white\"}}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":3,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"“Coaching that involves, empowers and inspires.”\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Dat is waar het voor mij om draait. In 2017 startte mijn ondernemersreis met een heldere missie: mensen meer en veelzijdiger laten bewegen. Inmiddels is die reis uitgegroeid tot eigenaarschap van een prachtige en inspirerende sportstudio in Groningen.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Sportlab betekent voor mij een plek waar mensen thuis kunnen komen, weg van huis. Een plek waar naar je geluisterd wordt en waar je jezelf kunt zijn. Natuurlijk zijn we een sportstudio waar je komt om je in het zweet te werken, kilo’s te sjouwen en te werken aan een sterkere versie van jezelf. Maar we zijn ook de plek waar je nieuwe vriendschappen aangaat, even los kunt laten na een zware dag en nieuwe energie opdoet.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Met inmiddels ruim tien jaar aan ervaring heb ik gemerkt dat coachen in mijn bloed zit. Het liefst wil ik die marathon met je meelopen, ik wil je ondersteunen bij die burn-out en ik wil je fitness samen met jou naar een nieuw niveau tillen. Coachen doe ik door bij je betrokken te zijn en te letten op de kleine details. Door een samenwerking met je aan te gaan. Durf jij die ook aan te gaan?\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Maak een afspraak\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"link\",\"version\":3,\"fields\":{\"doc\":{\"relationTo\":\"pages\",\"value\":{\"id\":2,\"title\":\"Contact\",\"slug\":\"contact\"}},\"size\":\"md\",\"variant\":\"orangeBorder\",\"linkType\":\"internal\",\"buttonSpacing\":\"md\",\"alignment\":\"left\"},\"id\":\"69c2b8c2ad0d815b6e1d02fd\"}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"root\",\"version\":1}},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-03-24T20:44:40.030Z\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-01-06T22:14:16.876Z\",\"email\":\"stefan@sportlabgroningen.nl\",\"sessions\":[{\"id\":\"ccfe8ba7-cc4c-4df1-8de6-19aa25e41716\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-14T13:12:54.050Z\",\"expiresAt\":\"2026-08-14T15:12:54.050Z\"}],\"collection\":\"users\"},{\"id\":3,\"name\":\"Amy McKeogh\",\"generateSlug\":false,\"slug\":\"amy-mckeogh\",\"status\":\"active\",\"roles\":[\"user\",\"coach\"],\"isCoach\":true,\"avatar\":null,\"subtitle\":\"Personal trainer & assistant manager personal training\",\"about\":\"\",\"position\":3,\"content\":{\"root\":{\"children\":[{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Amy McKeogh\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"heading\",\"version\":1,\"tag\":\"h2\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":3,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Personal trainer & Assistent manager personal training\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1,\"$\":{\"color\":\"white\",\"fontFamily\":\"montserrat\"}}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":3,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Originally from Ireland, I'm currently studying Sports Studies in Groningen, combining my academic knowledge with my passion for fitness and performance.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"I have been involved in both individual and team sports for most of my life, but at 15, I discovered Pilates and hybrid training, which sparked my interest in helping people move and feel better. Since then, I’ve focused on helping people stay injury-free, whether they’re recovering from something or simply looking to build a stronger, more resilient body.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"At Sportlab, you will mainly find me doing personal training, as well as leading Pre/Post Natal personal training, Core & Mobility, and Strength classes. My training style focuses on pushing people beyond what they think they're capable of while ensuring a fun, safe and welcoming atmosphere. Taking your fitness to the next level by focusing on the details, I’m here to help you become the strongest and fittest version of yourself.\",\"type\":\"text\",\"version\":1}],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[],\"direction\":null,\"format\":\"\",\"indent\":0,\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"version\":1,\"textFormat\":0,\"textStyle\":\"\"},{\"children\":[{\"children\":[{\"detail\":0,\"format\":0,\"mode\":\"normal\",\"style\":\"\",\"text\":\"Maak een afspraak\",